alue pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>53.1</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sheol\" title=\"Sheol\"><img alt=\"Stage Sheol icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Sheol icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Sheol_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/71/Stage_Sheol_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073042\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Room\" title=\"Dark Room\"><img alt=\"Stage Dark Room icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dark Room icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/60/Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072941\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devil_Room\" title=\"Devil Room\"><img alt=\"Devil Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Devil Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Devil_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Devil_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822040557\" /></a></span><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-7\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(except in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc nr indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_nr_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Dlc_nr_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20241126195308\" /></span></span>  Rare chance to replace &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dople\" title=\"Dople\"><img alt=\"Dople\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dople.png\" data-image-key=\"Dople.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/93/Dople.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20210821093354\" /></a></span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Doples</strong></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Evil Twins</b> shoot three spread blood shots instead of one but have a reduced fire rate. Also, due to the fact that they have flight, they cannot be hurt by spikes.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8 dlc-context-push\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span>  They can spawn in unique <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Devil Room\"><img alt=\"Devil Room\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Devil Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Devil_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Devil_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822040557\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Devil_Room\" title=\"Devil Room\">Devil Room</a> layouts if Isaac is holding the <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"t/tooltip&#124;Number+Magnet&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Number_Magnet\" title=\"Number Magnet\"><img alt=\"Number Magnet\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trinket Number Magnet icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trinket_Number_Magnet_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/61/Trinket_Number_Magnet_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825164917\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Number_Magnet\" title=\"Number Magnet\">Number Magnet</a></span>.<span class=\"dlc-context-pop\"></span></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_2\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Doples often appear in rooms that have hazards, such as Spikes. It is possible to kill a Dople by maneuvering Isaac in such a way that the Dople walks onto a hazard, though these spots are often blocked by obstacles such as rocks, key blocks, or &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Host\" title=\"Host\"><img alt=\"Host\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Host.png\" data-image-key=\"Host.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f1/Host.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821091757\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Host\" title=\"Host\">Hosts</a>.</li>\n<li>Doples and Evil Twins do not deal contact damage, allowing Isaac to utilize contact items like <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Mom%27s+Heels&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mom%27s_Heels\" title=\"Mom&#39;s Heels\"><img alt=\"Collectible Mom&#39;s Heels icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Mom&#39;s Heels icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Mom%27s_Heels_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/34/Collectible_Mom%27s_Heels_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821051755\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mom%27s_Heels\" title=\"Mom&#39;s Heels\">Mom's Heels</a></span> against them without risk.</li>\n<li>If Isaac attacks with an item that replaces regular tears with a charged attack such as <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Brimstone&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brimstone\" title=\"Brimstone\"><img alt=\"Collectible Brimstone icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Brimstone icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Brimstone_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/46/Collectible_Brimstone_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821045528\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Brimstone\" title=\"Brimstone\">Brimstone</a></span>, Doples and Evil Twins will only attack when the beam first starts to charge up.</li>\n<li>If Isaac is <a href=\"/wiki/Blindfolded\" title=\"Blindfolded\">blindfolded</a>, Doples and Evil Twins will not attack.</li>\n<li>If Isaac has low tear delay, the Dople (but not the Evil Twin) will fire very rapidly at the same rate as Isaac, making it very dangerous.</li>\n<li>The Dople, despite mirroring Isaac's movements exactly, do not mimic his range. As a result, they can be significantly easier if Isaac has a higher range and attacks from as much of a distance as possible.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-3\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Rebirth and Afterbirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc na† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_na%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cc/Dlc_na%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130012017\" /></span></span>  If you are to charm a Dople/Evil Twin in a room with other enemies, the Dople/Evil Twin will try to copy the movement of every other enemy in the room, resulting in teleportation all around the room at very high speeds.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8 dlc-context-push\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span>  When playing with multiple characters, such as <span> <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jacob_and_Esau\" title=\"Jacob and Esau\"><img alt=\"Character Jacob and Esau icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Character Jacob and Esau icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Character_Jacob_and_Esau_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/fa/Character_Jacob_and_Esau_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210824132912\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Jacob_and_Esau\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jacob and Esau\">Jacob and Esau</a></span> or when using <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"p/tooltip&#124;Soul+of+the+Forgotten&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cards_and_Runes\" title=\"Soul of the Forgotten\"><img alt=\"Soul of the Forgotten\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pickup Soul of the Forgotten icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Pickup_Soul_of_the_Forgotten_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/ad/Pickup_Soul_of_the_Forgotten_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/13?cb=20210825170038\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cards_and_Runes#Soul_of_the_Forgotten\" title=\"Cards and Runes\">Soul of the Forgotten</a></span>, Doples/Evil Twins will mimic only one of them. Multiple Doples/Evil Twins will mimic different characters.<span class=\"dlc-context-pop\"></span>\n<ul><li>If a temporary character dies, their Dople/Evil Twin will also die.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Evil Twins appear to have <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;The+Inner+Eye&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Inner_Eye\" title=\"The Inner Eye\"><img alt=\"Collectible The Inner Eye icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible The Inner Eye icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_The_Inner_Eye_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/45/Collectible_The_Inner_Eye_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20220421082647\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Inner_Eye\" title=\"The Inner Eye\">The Inner Eye</a></span> ability, given the fact that it has a spread of 3 shots and a slower fire rate compared to Doples.</li>\n<li>Doples and Evil Twins are based on the term doppelganger, which means a double of a living person.</li>\n<li>Doples are a reference to Doppelgängers from the game <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tomb_Raider\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Tomb Raider\">Tomb Raider</a>. It's a replica of Lara Croft, the protagonist of the video game, and can be found in The Great Pyramid. It's a skinless creature that would mirror the player's movements and could be tricked into jumping into a pit of molten lava.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<table class=\"bug\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span class=\"mw-default-size inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Undefined icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Undefined_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2e/Collectible_Undefined_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20221115212719\" /></span></span> Bug!\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8 dlc-context-push\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span>  Maximum mirroring tear rate of a Dople is 15. From 15 to 30 they will fire slower like from 15 to 0 and above 30 they will only fire one tear.<span class=\"dlc-context-pop\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><img alt=\"MainPageAchievements\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"MainPageAchievements.png\" data-image-key=\"MainPageAchievements.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/26/MainPageAchievements.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151124025857\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\">Achievements</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenges\" title=\"Challenges\"><img a